--- !u!1001 &7581514022425606337
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 0}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 422723014597737663, guid: 180fb47de8c698242a68e1042150a92a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "CONVERGENCE\nA SAVAGE LEGENDS GAME\\n\n\nTHANK YOU FOR PLAYING!\\n\\n\n\nSTUDENT
        TEAM DEVELOPERS:\\n\nHead of Code, Chaos, & Crisis Management - Jeremy Desfosses\\n\nInterface
        Alchemist & Menu Magician - Zachery Burlakoff\\n\nDungeon Daddy - Dylan Williams\\n\nSound
        Sorcerer & Monster Wrangler - Teresa Shaver\\n\nMaster of Bullets, Bandages,
        & Bad Surprises - Michael Witkowski\\n\nChief Shopkeeper & Part-Time Pixel
        Pusher - Kylar Eden-Potach\\n\\n\n\nA Special Thanks to our Teachers:\\n\nGrandmaster
        of C# Spells & Unity Basics - Prof. Rod Moye\\n\nSprint Master & Trelloist
        - Prof. John O'Leske\\n\nThe Rapid Response Reviewer - Prof. Shawn Paris\\n\\n\n\nEarly
        Development Contributers: \\n\nCode Consultant from a Parallel Timeline:
        Sam Haan\\n\nPrototype Support Developer: Austin Carey\\n\\n\n\nA Heartfelt
        (& Slightly Chaotic) Thank\u2011You:\\n\nTo our families, friends, roommates,
        & emotional\u2011support snacks \\n\nThank you for cheering us on, testing
        our game, & pretending to understand what we were talking about.\\n\\n\n\nA
        Funny Blip for our Third Party Contributors:\\n\nFor Assets of All Kinds:\\n\nTo
        every generous soul who uploaded a model, texture, particle effect, or mysterious
        prefab \u2014\nwe couldn\u2019t have done it without your digital treasure
        hoard.\\n\\n\n\nMusic & SFX: Thank you for the bangers, the booms, & all
        the weird noises\\n\\n\nTwilight Game Menu(Short, Pixabay) by Siarhei Korbut
        from Pixabay.com/music\\n\nGame Over (retrowaver, synthwave, vaporwave, retro,
        80's) by Artur Aravidi Music from pixabay.com/music\\n\nTense Suspense Background
        Music by HitsLab from pixabay.com/music\\n\nJonathon Gaming by Onetent from
        Pixabay.com/music\\n\n Synthwave Shooter music pack by Alkakrab from itch.io\\n\nEpic
        Cinematic Battle Music by Tunetank from Pixabay.com/music \\n\nBro Audio
        by Ami Production from assetstore.unity.com\\n\nFantasy SFX for Particle
        Distort Texture Effect Library by Moonflower Carnivore from assetstore.unity.com\\n\nFast
        UI Sounds - Sound Effects by AD Sounds from assetstore.unity.com\\n\nMonster
        Roars - Audio Pack by VoiceBosch from assetstore.unity.com\\n\nRPG Essentials
        Sound Effects - FREE! by leohpaz from assetstore.unity.com\\n\nSci-fi Guns
        SFX Pack by Mikael Vanninen from assetstore.unity.com\\n\nCybernetic Onslaught
        (Aggressive Heavy Metal for Gaming & Action) by NickPanek from Pixabay.com/music\n\nCharacters
        & Animation & VFX:\\n\nThank you, your models survived our code. That alone
        deserves an applause.\\n\\n\nDragon for Boss Monster:PBR by Dungeon Mason
        from assetstore.unity.com\\n\nEgypt Pack by OpenLab from assetstore.unity.com\\n\nFREE-32
        RPG Animations by Blink from assetstore.unity.com\\n\nFree Fire VFX - URP
        by Vefects from assetstore.unity.com\\n\nHit Effects FREE by Matthew Guz
        from assetstore.unity.com\\n\nHumanoid Robot Avatar Set - Mecanim Compatible
        by LB3D from assetstore.unity.com\\n\nInsectoid Crab Monster:Lurker of the
        Shores(20 Animations) by LB3D from assetstore.unity.com\\n\nMagic Effects
        FREE by Hovl Studio from assetstore.unity.com\\n\nProcedural Fire by Hovl
        Studio from assetstore.unity.com\\n\nSci-Fi Drones by Lukas Bobor from assetstore.unity.com\\n\n\n\nLevel
        Design Resources:\\n\nThank you, you gave us props & enviroments that helped
        us transform empty space into this awesome game. \\n\\n\nCity Voxel Pack
        by PoeMe from assetstore.unity.com\\n\nFirst Aid Jar by SIUP from assetstore.unity.com\\n\nFree
        Industrial building/Garage by Reinforcedcc from assetstore.unity.com\\n\nFree
        Lava Shader by AYproduct from assetstore.unity.com\\n\nRPG/FPS Game Assets
        for PC/Mobile (Industrial Set V.2.0 by Dmitri Kutsenko from assetstore.unity.com\\n\nRusty
        Cars by Duane's Mind from assetstore.unity.com\\n\nSci-Fi guns|Plug and Play
        by The Developer Train from assetstore.unity.com\\n\nSimple Keys by 3Digitalis
        from assetstore.unity.com\\n\nTower Defense Sci-Fi Turret (FREE) by Firazdo
        from assetstore.unity.com\\n\nVending Machines - Lowpoly 3D Pixel Art Pack
